Package: graphs
Type: Package
Title: Your Favorite Graph Algorithms, Now Streaming Online
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-06-03
Authors@R: person("Paweł", "Buczyński", role = c("aut", "cre"), email =
       "pkb.pmj@gmail.com")
Description: Online/streaming/incremental variants of popular graph algorithms
       (currently triangle counting),
       optimized for fast incremental updates of single vertices/edges,
       without the need for recomputing from scratch on every update.
